'''Shakurel Lion''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and can be unlocked by purchasing a special sale which contains Shakurel Lion and 300 [[Cat Food]] during the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 498
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Shakurel Lion
|name2 = Shakurel Lion CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shakurel Lion CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Although Shakurel Lion has good health, his Crit is unreliable and getting a Wave and a Crit is extremely low. In early game, he can be used as Critter if there is nothing else, but is outclassed by Jurrasic Cat and Space Cat. So this cat's only use is for your user rank and collection.

{{Job|Classification = Critter & Melee}}

